{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["Of the red, this red stuff — the way of a person who hurries to ask of his fellow is to double his words, and this one who was famished — it is as though he says: Give me quickly to eat." "Therefore his name was called Edom — he was reddish and craved to eat something red. And on account of his gluttony he sold his birthright, and for a name of disgrace he was called thus: because of red food he sold his birthright."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:11.569733975Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}